; Three read-only CodeEdit boxes of 300x120, each with its own CodeHighlighter. The one variable of each is
; font_readonly_color: Default leaves it; Faint sets alpha 0.3; Yellow sets an opaque yellow. A read-only node
; draws the highlighter's plain colour from font_color (syntax_highlighter.cpp:421) and caps every highlighted
; alpha at font_readonly_color's (text_edit.cpp:1666-1668). unit-code-edit-syntax-highlighter shows an editable
; node, so none of its pixels depends on either rule.

[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitcodeeditreadonlyhl"]

[sub_resource type="CodeHighlighter" id="CodeHighlighter_a"]
